Subject: Cantor Deterministic Runtime Activation

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a future separately claimed, effectless, in-memory deterministic CTPR runtime covering fake repository, logical Calendar and Planner, tandem coordination, replay, and bounded compiler-diff fixtures. It grants no live effect, provider, persistence, service, model, procedure-language, or hardware authority.

